OL,3,GNEWSAPolice shut A1 stretch after
OL,4,Atwo-car collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the A1 near Peterborough has
OL,7,Fbeen shut after a collision involving
OL,8,Ftwo cars.
OL,10,FPolice have closed the southbound
OL,11,Fcarriageway between Stamford,
OL,12,FLincolnshire, and Wansford in
OL,13,FCambridgeshire.
OL,15,FIn a post on X, National Highways said
OL,16,Fthere were delays of 20 minutes - and
OL,17,Fthree miles (4.8km) of congestion.
OL,19,FA diversion route has been put in place
OL,20,Ffor motorists.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
